      "message": "T36: H1 and H2 verdicts and McNemar tests from the saved test run\n\nBoth verdicts are inconclusive: B7 gains 3.2 points of recovery over B4 (CI -0.1 to +10.6), and its\nharmful-inference rate is 3.9% (CI 1.3 to 7.4) against the 5% target and is not lower than B5.\nRisk control barely binds with 26 calibration patients.",
